Z||000000||FieroGTGirl||06-28-2000||07:22 PM||||We bought a 2000 Grand Am GT.  I love to drive it...Not that I don't like to drive the Fiero, but I love the options with our Grand Am(not to mention the space).<P>I was thinking maybe my name should just be GTGirl!? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>  ||||reg||6
