Z||000002||FieroGTGirl||06-28-2000||10:23 PM||||It is Silvermist Metallic (basically silver).   Coconut thinks we should've gotten red.<P>For an automatic it does have some horses!  I am impressed by the power it has and I like it! I prefer standard transmission, but I think this will be a pleasure to drive.  I guess when I want to mix those gears I'll drive our Fiero! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I am really impressed with the stereo in this car!   Awesome, We won't need to do anything to the stereo. <P>Sorry about rambling on I am just excited...First time We bought a "new" car.  <P>Thanks for listening.... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>GTGirl  <P>||||reg||2
